// codebox_nl.gen -- f_formconstants PARITY wc stage (spec Revision 2, S2 + S4 + S5).
// Port of the page's `wc` shader, Example-10 constants, dt = 1:
//   Ve = F(10.5 cE - 8.5 cI - 2.0 + s)      Vi = F(12 cE - 3 cI - 3.5)
//   E += (Ve - E) * dt/10                    I += (Vi - I) * dt/20
//   out = (q(E), q(I), q8(3 |E - I|), 1)     q(x) = floor(255 x + 0.5)/255
// B is built from the UNquantized updated E, I and stored through an 8-bit target (clamp, round).
// Mirror: fc_parity_mirror.wc_step().
// Inputs: in1 = the convolved fields (R = blur(E), G = blur(I), from blur_y), in2 = the raw state
// (R = E, G = I, from pass -- the relaxation target is the same frame as the convolved input).
//   - s = s_depth * mix(square, luma(pulse), pulse_conn), E sigmoid input only (Phase D T061, Matt
//     2026-10-24: REPLACE semantics, CORTICAL space). square = (fract(frameno / s_period) < 0.5): the
//     page's wave at the defaults (depth 0.6, period 500/3.4 ~ 147 frames). in3 = the pulse inlet
//     (through a vs_inState: UNCONNECTED reads vs_black and the patcher sets pulse_conn = 0, so the
//     internal wave runs), Rec. 709 luma, bilinear `sample` with normalized coords (any input size).
//     frameno = the frame counter (patcher; wraps at 1000000, ~4.6 h at 60 fps -- one phase jump then;
//     NOT named `t`: a Param called t is never applied by jit.gl.pix, probed 2026-10-24).
//     s acts as an excitability level (tests/records/spike_fc_pulse_shapes.py): depth 0 fades the
//     field out over ~1000 frames, depth ~1.5 or a steady 0.6 kills it, periods under ~100 die --
//     all reachable on purpose (kill and revive is a performance gesture).
//   - no noise, no habituation, no clamps (the page has none); the NaN guard lives in pass
//   - Phase D T062 (Matt, 2026-10-25): Param q_levels from the Quant menu -- 0 = 255 levels (the source,
//     S2), 1 = 1023, 2 = float (no quantization). Every level >= 255 lives; below 255 the field freezes
//     (tests/records/spike_fc_quant_levels.py), so the menu offers only the living span.
//   - constants are literals (the page's `parameters`); frameno / s_depth / s_period / pulse_conn
//     are the only Params. Mirror: fc_parity_mirror.wc_step(..., s=s_pulse(...)).
//   - no unary minus before a parenthesis (GenExpr mis-parses it)
Param frameno(0);
Param s_depth(0.6);
Param s_period(147.0588);
Param pulse_conn(0);
Param q_levels(0);

ce = nearest(in1, norm).x;
ci = nearest(in1, norm).y;
ee = nearest(in2, norm).x;
ii = nearest(in2, norm).y;
pl = sample(in3, norm);
lum = 0.2126 * pl.x + 0.7152 * pl.y + 0.0722 * pl.z;
sq = fract(frameno / s_period) < 0.5;
s = s_depth * mix(sq, lum, pulse_conn);

ve = 1 / (1 + exp(0 - (10.5 * ce - 8.5 * ci - 2.0 + s)));
vi = 1 / (1 + exp(0 - (12.0 * ce - 3.0 * ci - 3.5)));
en = ee + (ve - ee) * 0.1;
inw = ii + (vi - ii) * 0.05;
bb = clamp(abs(en - inw) * 3.0, 0, 1);

lv = 255 + 768 * (q_levels > 0.5);
qon = q_levels < 1.5;
qe = mix(en, floor(lv * en + 0.5) / lv, qon);
qi = mix(inw, floor(lv * inw + 0.5) / lv, qon);
qbb = mix(bb, floor(lv * bb + 0.5) / lv, qon);

out1 = vec(qe, qi, qbb, 1);
